{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1204"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",136],["+","firm takes its name from its senior partners: the silver-haired charmer Roger Sterling, whose father co-founded it in 1923, and the eccentric Bertram Cooper. When Sterling Cooper is sold in 1963, Roger, Cooper, Draper and Lane Pryce walk out to start again as Sterling Cooper Draper Pryce. The "],["=",14],["+","more "],["=",801]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",132],["+","Ihren Namen hat die Firma von ihren Seniorpartnern: dem silberhaarigen Charmeur Roger Sterling, dessen Vater sie 1923 mitgegründet hatte, und dem exzentrischen Bertram Cooper. Als Sterling Cooper 1963 verkauft wird, gehen Roger, Cooper, Draper und Lane Pryce und fangen als Sterling Cooper Draper Pryce neu an. "],["=",12],["+","noch "],["=",775]]}]},
